OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see clear periods and a few
OL,7,Fshowers. The rest of the night will
OL,8,Fbecome mainly dry but still the odd
OL,9,Fshower in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FJust a few showers at first
OL,12,Fbut widespread rain, occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy, will spread northeast later in
OL,14,Fthe morning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,15,Fwill spread from the west by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
